    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "WorkArena++ builds upon the WorkArena benchmark, which consists of atomic tasks that measure the ability of web agents to interact with basic UI components in the ServiceNow platform. WorkArena++ introduces two new levels of difficulty, L2 and L3, which require skills like planning, problem-solving, and data-driven decision-making. The benchmark is integrated into the BrowserGym environment, which provides a standardized and flexible action space for web agents. <strong>Each task in WorkArena++</strong> consists of a logical combination of simpler atomic tasks, chained together to form a realistic workflow.",
