    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The results of the empirical study on WorkArena++ show that state-of-the-art web agents struggle to achieve reasonable success on the benchmark, while humans achieve extremely high performance. The best-performing agents, GPT-4o and GPT-4o-v, succeed at some tasks, particularly memorization tasks within the L2 set, but fail to achieve any reasonable success on the L3 set. <strong>Human evaluation</strong> reveals that WorkArena++ is a valuable benchmark that is both solvable and relatively straightforward for humans, while being challenging for state-of-the-art LLMs.",
